  "title": "Garmin achieves certification of the GFC 600 digital autopilot in Air Tractor and Piper Matrix aircraft",
  "summary": "OLATHE, Kan./June 17, 2026 — Garmin (NYSE: GRMN) today announced it has received Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) Supplemental Type Certification (STC) for the GFC™ 600 digital autopilot in Air Tractor AT-802 and AT-802(A) models and Piper Matrix PA-46R-350T aircraft. Certification for Cessna 310P/Q aircraft is expected in July. The GFC 600 digital autopilot is designed […]",
